{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/2628831cc5af65667373bbb737ea62f0.poster.avif?t=1739053759\" width=590 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/2628831cc5af65667373bbb737ea62f0.webm?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/2628831cc5af65667373bbb737ea62f0.mp4?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your friends are nearby or far away, you can play together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer is locally supported using either controllers or only your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Remote Play can be set up easily. Follow the Steam guide to learn more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/ce522ae941be173d843725798cb3e361.poster.avif?t=1739053759\" width=590 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/ce522ae941be173d843725798cb3e361.webm?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/ce522ae941be173d843725798cb3e361.mp4?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shuffle shells, beat your record, unlock new gamemodes, save a hermit crab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive and approachable game with an unbelievable amount of depth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by the bright colors and fun shapes, this game is a challenge that will take skill, practice, and time to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access we're looking for feedback on the gamemodes we have released while we come up with ideas to improve the gameplay further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be apart of that process and let us know what you think on the forums!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/f2201575639cc91b67bb66bec1206b53.poster.avif?t=1739053759\" width=590 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/f2201575639cc91b67bb66bec1206b53.webm?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/f2201575639cc91b67bb66bec1206b53.mp4?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One extremely cynical parrot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun singleplayer gamemodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced competitive local multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark mode for playing at night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awesome pearl activated power ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An absolute banger of a soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/054df090a7c5ad41ccca81e750fe1732.poster.avif?t=1739053759\" width=424 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/054df090a7c5ad41ccca81e750fe1732.webm?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/054df090a7c5ad41ccca81e750fe1732.mp4?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1395450?t=1739053759","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739053759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739053759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739053759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1437590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/2628831cc5af65667373bbb737ea62f0.poster.avif?t=1739053759\" width=590 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/2628831cc5af65667373bbb737ea62f0.webm?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/2628831cc5af65667373bbb737ea62f0.mp4?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether your friends are nearby or far away, you can play together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer is locally supported using either controllers or only your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Remote Play can be set up easily. Follow the Steam guide to learn more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/ce522ae941be173d843725798cb3e361.poster.avif?t=1739053759\" width=590 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/ce522ae941be173d843725798cb3e361.webm?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/ce522ae941be173d843725798cb3e361.mp4?t=1739053759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shuffle shells, beat your record, unlock new gamemodes, save a hermit crab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An addictive and approachable game with an unbelievable amount of depth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be fooled by the bright colors and fun shapes, this game is a challenge that will take skill, practice, and time to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During Early Access we're looking for feedback on the gamemodes we have released while we come up with ideas to improve the gameplay further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be apart of that process and let us know what you think on the forums!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1395450/extras/f2201575639cc